---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Résumé – Hanh Tran"
  description="Résumé of Tran Thi Hong Hanh, Applied AI Engineer and founder."
  current="resume"
  footer="compact"
>
<main style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; box-sizing: border-box">

<section style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px 40px; padding: 40px 0 32px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; flex: 999 1 420px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.035em; font-weight: 600">Tran Thi Hong Hanh</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Applied AI Engineer · Founder. Agents, MCP and AI coding workflows; developer educator.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2px 20px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">
<span style="padding: 8px 0">Paris, France</span>
<a href="mailto:h@tihado.com" style="color: var(--muted); padding: 8px 0">h@tihado.com</a>
<a href="https://github.com/honghanhh" style="color: var(--muted); padding: 8px 0">github.com/honghanhh</a>
<a href="https://tihado.com" style="color: var(--muted); padding: 8px 0">tihado.com</a>
</div>
</div>
<a href="/resume.pdf" style="flex: 0 0 auto; text-decoration: none; background: var(--ink); color: var(--on-ink); font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 6px; padding: 13px 22px">Download PDF ↓</a>
</section>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 56px; padding: 32px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink)">

<div style="flex: 999 1 480px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 36px">

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Experience</h2>

<article style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 16px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em">Founder · Tihado</h3>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">2024 – Present</div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">AI product studio; with a team of four, took five award-winning prototypes from idea to working demo in days: Pozify, Posey and Vidzly (1st places), Lumen and EatAble (3rd places).</p>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 16px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em">NLP Research Engineer · Arkhn</h3>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">2024 – Present</div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Agentic assistant over patient data, selected in France’s 2025 public-sector AI call. OCR and extraction pipelines on 88M medical documents across 15 hospitals. Deployed with 19 of 32 French university hospitals.</p>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 16px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em">PhD Researcher · La Rochelle &amp; Jožef Stefan Institute</h3>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">2021 – 2024</div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Terminology-extraction pipelines shipped into the Slovenian Terminology Portal. 20+ peer-reviewed papers and a Best Paper Award (TPDL 2024).</p>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 16px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em">Data Scientist / ML Engineer · 3T JSC</h3>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">2020 – 2021</div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Credit-scoring system in production at one major bank and two fintechs; call-centre KPI system scoring 10,000 calls per day.</p>
</article>

<article style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2px 16px">
<h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em">Data Scientist · Samsung SDS</h3>
<div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">2019 – 2020</div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Legal-document feature of the Brightics AI platform: provision classification and entity extraction.</p>
</article>

<a href="/experience" style="font-weight: 500; padding: 10px 0; align-self: flex-start">Full experience →</a>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Teaching &amp; talks</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Instructor at VietAI since 2021 (ML, deep learning, NLP): 1,200+ students over 10 cohorts. Speaker at Women in AI and Women Techmakers events; seminars at the University of Coimbra and the University of Malta.</p>
</section>

</div>

<aside style="flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px">

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Skills</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">AI coding tools</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Codex, Claude Code, Cursor, MCP servers</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">AI engineering</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Agents, LangChain, DeepEval, Langfuse, OCR, information extraction</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">ML and NLP</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">PyTorch, Transformers, spaCy, scikit-learn, PySpark</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">Software</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Python, FastAPI, SQL, Docker, CI/CD, ArgoCD, GCP</div>
</div>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Education</h2>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">PhD, Computer Science</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">La Rochelle University &amp; Jožef Stefan Institute · 2021 – 2024</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">MSc</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">University of Montpellier · 2019 – 2020</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px">
<div style="font-weight: 600">BSc</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">University of Science and Technology of Hanoi · 2014 – 2017</div>
</div>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Certification</h2>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--body)">Google Cloud Associate Cloud Engineer · June 2025</div>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted)">Languages</h2>
<div style="font-size: 16px; color: var(--body)">Vietnamese (native), English (C1), French (B2), Spanish (A1)</div>
</section>

</aside>

</div>

</main>
</Layout>
